<div class="sat-reflection">
  <h4>Activity 6: Storm Damage Scenario</h4>
  <p class="sat-reflection__prompt">You are an agronomist in Iowa. Recently a big storm with hail went through and damaged the leaves on your crop. You need to figure out the amount of damage caused by the hail to determine if you will be able to harvest your crop this year.</p>
  <p class="sat-reflection__prompt"><strong>How can a satellite help after this hailstorm?</strong></p>
  <textarea class="sat-reflection__input" rows="4" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  <p class="sat-reflection__note">This isn't saved anywhere &mdash; it's just a space to think it through before you write it down elsewhere.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .sat-reflection {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin: 30px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }
  .sat-reflection h4 {
    color: var(--isu-red);
    font-size: 1.2em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: Georgia, Garamond, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  }
  .sat-reflection__prompt {
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .sat-reflection__input {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 14px;
    font-family: Georgia, Garamond, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    resize: vertical;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .sat-reflection__note {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>